   "date": "2018-11-16T03:08:09Z",
   "subject": "Re: dartR update alerts",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Now that we have this forum established, there will be an announcement each time a new stable version is placed on github and/or on CRAN.</div><div><br></div><div>You can access these with</div><div><br></div><div>\n\n<h3><a name=\"m_-7115994931532405317__Toc529534439\" rel=\"nofollow\">Installing from CRAN</a> </h3><p style=\"margin:12pt 0cm 12pt 0.9cm\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:blue;layout-grid-mode:both\">install.packages(&quot;dartR&quot;)<br>library(dartR)</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:LMRoman10-Regular\"></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"></span></p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"m_-7115994931532405317__Toc529534440\" rel=\"nofollow\">Installing from GitHub</a></h3>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:12pt;margin-left:40px\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:blue;layout-grid-mode:both\">install.packages(&quot;devtools&quot;)</span></span></p><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">\n\n</div><p style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:blue;layout-grid-mode:both\">library(devtools)</span></span></p><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">\n\n</div><p style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:blue;layout-grid-mode:both\">install_github(&quot;green-striped-gecko/dartR&quot;)</span></span></p><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">\n\n</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:12pt;margin-left:40px\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:blue;layout-grid-mode:both\">library(dartR)</span></span></p><h3><a name=\"m_-7115994931532405317__Toc529534440\" rel=\"nofollow\">Installing the developmental version (always up to date)</a></h3><p style=\"margin-top:12pt;margin-left:40px\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:blue;layout-grid-mode:both\">install.packages(&quot;devtools&quot;)</span></span></p><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">\n\n</div><p style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:blue;layout-grid-mode:both\">library(devtools)</span></span></p><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">\n\n</div><p style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:blue;layout-grid-mode:both\">install_github(&quot;green-striped-gecko/dartR&quot;, ref=&quot;dev&quot;)</span></span></p><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">\n\n</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:12pt;margin-left:40px\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:blue;layout-grid-mode:both\">library(dartR)</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:12pt\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:blue;layout-grid-mode:both\">Hope this helps.<br></span></span></p><h3><a name=\"m_-7115994931532405317__Toc529534440\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a></h3><p style=\"margin-bottom:12pt;margin-left:40px\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:blue;layout-grid-mode:both\"></span></span></p>\n\n</div></div>"
